  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: wonderland is the state of the art low cost family luxury resort,  with
    a fully automated house keeping and our loveble mascots, wonderland has been
    entertaining guest from all over the world,  but we didnt start out like at the
    top, Jack Bloodhaven(the founder of wonderland) was a simple mechanic working
    for some big arcade company. dispite that Bloodhaven didnt give a single care,
    he just loved to working on the atractions, his favorite was the animatronics, 
    all those moving parts to make a convincing imitation of life was just so amusing
    to him, but then disaster struck, the company that he worked for was close to
    bankruptsy and laid off over 5.billion people. him being included in the mass
    unemployment,  Bloodhaven walks home devestated from the terrible news he has
    recived sadly sulking on his couch, but then he remembers the theme park his
    father used to own down in Cansas, and gets the golden idea of a life time, "what
    if i made a business", and thats what he did nameing it wonderland.inc in honor
    of his dad. then in 1987, Bloodhaven opens his first location, the pineapple
    plaza, wher you can feel like a kid. the place was a huge hit being popular for
    families that wanted a fun and affordible experiance, so much that he was able
    to expand his company and help other companies get insporation and traction just
    like his old pa, eventualy opening a second new and improved location in New
    Arrow, leading us to the wonderland we know today, here at wonderland we pride
    ourselves to make the most helpfull, safe, and fun environment for everyone to
    enjoy. after all thats what the founder would want.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
